  日盈 · Gain, 日日行动，日日有盈: one unbroken line looping three times round, a trefoil knot, is the
  acting day after day; the sun it rings in the middle is what builds up. Where the line passes under
  itself both its edges stop square to the strand above, so it reads as going beneath, not broken off.
  The art sits in a circle of radius 22.3 at the middle, well inside the adaptive icon's 66dp safe zone.
  Generated from the (2,3) torus knot, r = s·(2.9 + cos 3t), the cosine eased to round the loops.
-->
